          "snippet": {
            "line": 1121,
            "text": "theorem linearResidual_eq (U : LocalSignedRequest.SlowRegion (2*h))\n    (j : Fin 2) (L : Label B N0) (n : ℕ) {x : FullPoint}\n    (hx : x ∈ ActualPrimaryCoherence.positiveRadialChart) (i : Fin 3) :\n    (piece U j L).linearResidual n x i =\n      (piece U j L).linearGoodField n x i + (piece U j L).excluded n x i"
